// What each ability throws as it is wound up and used, so it can be named
// from the motion alone, with the HUD hidden (#18;
// docs/philosophy/combat-rhythm.md). The horse's own swing for each, and
// so when each phase starts, is in attacks.ron, `casts`; these are only
// what is drawn round it. A shot and a burst take their ability's element
// colour. Change one value at a time and look at it (--seed 6, a fight
// from 5 s). Lengths are world units (a horse is about 2 long), times
// seconds.
(
    // A shot: an orb gathers in front of the horse's chest through the
    // wind-up and is thrown at the first enemy standing as the release
    // starts, reaching it as the hit lands.
    //   size:  its diameter, full grown
    //   ahead: how far in front of the horse's middle it gathers, and how
    //          far up
    //   arc:   how high its flight rises in the middle
    //   pulse: how far it swells and shrinks as it gathers, a share of its
    //          size, and how many times a second
    orb: (size: 0.7, ahead: (1.2, 0.35), arc: 1.2, pulse: (0.15, 6.0)),
    // A burst: a ring of shards on the ground closes in round the horse
    // through the wind-up, from `from` wide to `to`; on the release it
    // rushes out to past the furthest enemy standing, reaching them as the
    // hits land, and runs on `beyond` further as it shrinks away over
    // `fade_secs`.
    //   count: how many shards, each `size` on a side
    //   across: the furthest it spreads across the trail, either side of
    //           the horse, so a wide ring stays on the ground as a long
    //           ellipse rather than leaving the trail
    ring: (count: 40, size: 0.22, from: 3.0, to: 1.0, beyond: 2.0, fade_secs: 0.35, across: 1.6),
    // The Ward: a glow round the horse raising it swells through the
    // wind-up; as it is raised a bubble closes over every horse standing,
    // `grow_secs` to full. It holds while the Ward lasts and, in its last
    // `warn_secs`, flickers `flicker` times a second; when the Ward ends
    // the bubble swells by `pop` and is gone in `pop_secs`.
    //   radius: the bubble's, round a horse's middle: along the trail, up
    //           and across it; the glow's is `glow` times it
    //   alpha:  how much it covers what is behind it
    ward: (
        colour: "f4e3a1",
        radius: (1.5, 1.25, 1.0),
        alpha: 0.30,
        glow: 0.8,
        grow_secs: 0.15,
        warn_secs: 1.0,
        flicker: 6.0,
        pop: 1.35,
        pop_secs: 0.3,
    ),
)
